ty occludes explosions); blood splatter offsets through random_point_in_ring (clang-cl evaluates call arguments right to left); remnants over the hard limit deleted in sorted order (partial_sort); damage owners stable-sorted; hostile entries fully ordered; ranked suspended/abandoned players in std::map. On a desync the client writes logs/desync.<time>.step<step>.txt: every character's hashed body transform and meters plus bots' paths - its own at the desync and right before the resync snapshot, next to the server's from it. Test tooling: build_claude.sh SUFFIX (e.g. a libstdc++ build, which breaks ties like MSVC STL), run_map.sh CLIENT_BIN.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"NVIDIA/cudnn-frontend","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:58:46Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"f4639c3d70a1d86b1e4faac843f0c466f1e2f8cb","github_link":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cudnn-frontend/commit/f4639c3d70a1d86b1e4faac843f0c466f1e2f8cb","commit_subject":"sdpa fwd default dispatch: square causal masks; cc 10.7 D64 packing and dense decode; cc 10.3 sliding window; A100 dense prefill (#2118)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"archi-physics/archi","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:58:39Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"0af90cc4fb9b46afc98d49cef8192a510521b225","github_link":"https://github.com/archi-physics/archi/commit/0af90cc4fb9b46afc98d49cef8192a510521b225","commit_subject":"Merge pull request #885 from archi-physics/claude/r3-ticket-triage-g2","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"microsoft/vscode","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:58:14Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"d78bac45fca4483294409671a64e42d21a54c36c","github_link":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/commit/d78bac45fca4483294409671a64e42d21a54c36c","commit_subject":"Fix pet propeller accessory rendering (#345386)","ai_tool":"Copilot"},{"repo_name":"graphistry/pygraphistry","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:58:07Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"2b178bb55367e4ebe43b562107eb7fe63c322927","github_link":"https://github.com/graphistry/